[49.000053, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll start by inspecting the repository structure, contents of `info.md`, and any existing GitHub workflows before making changes.\r\n\r\n```\r\npwd && find . -maxdepth 3 -type f -not -path './.git/*' -print | sort && echo '--- git status ---' && git status --short --branch 2>&1 && echo '--- remotes ---'\r\n&& git remote -v 2>&1\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
