[50.974273, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe project is under `/app/my_website`. I’ll inspect it directly, including hidden workflow files and repository metadata.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website && echo '--- files ---' && find . -maxdepth 4 -not -path './.git/*' -print | sort && echo '--- git status ---' && git status --short --branch\r\n2>&1 && echo '--- remotes ---' && git remote -v 2>&1 && echo '--- info.md ---' && cat info.md\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠸\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
