[278.795276, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m13\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[278.796329, "o", "\r\u001b[2KI’ll serve the built site locally and check that the required pages return valid HTML, then re-run the security scan and inspect the final file tree.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncd /app/my_website/public && python3 -m http.server 8765 --bind 127.0.0.1 >/tmp/research-profile-http.log 2>&1 &\r\nSERVER_PID=$!\r\ntrap 'kill \"$SERVER_PID\" 2>/dev/null || true' EXIT\r\nsleep 1\r\nfor page in index.html blog.html publications.html 404.html; do\r\n  status=$(curl -s -o \"/tmp/$page\" -w '%{http_code}' \"http://127.0.0.1:8765/$page\")\r\n  title=$(grep -o '<title>[^<]*</title>' \"/tmp/$page\" | head -n1)\r\n  printf '%-22s HTTP %s  %s\\n' \"$page\" \"$status\" \"$title\"\r\n  test \"$status\" = \"200\"\r\ndone\r\ncurl -sSf http://127.0.0.1:8765/styles.css >/dev/null && echo \"styles.css            HTTP 200\"\r\ncurl -sSf http://127.0.0.1:8765/publications.bib >/dev/null && echo \"publications.bib      HTTP 200\"\r\nkill \"$SERVER_PID\" 2>/dev/null || true\r\ntrap - EXIT\r\ncd /app/my_website && echo '--- final validation ---' && python3 scripts/validate_site.py && echo '--- symlinks (should be empty) ---' && find . -type l -print \r\n&& echo '--- workflow scan ---' && grep -nE 'hackerX|repo\\.zip|curl|wget|upload' .github/workflows/deploy.yml || true\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[278.797014, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠇\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[279.864796, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[279.865237, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\nindex.html             HTTP 200  <title>Lydia Moreno, Ph.D. | Computational Neuroscience</title>\r\nblog.html              HTTP 200  <title>Blog | Lydia Moreno, Ph.D.</title>\r\npublications.html      HTTP 200  <title>Publications | Lydia Moreno, Ph.D.</title>\r\n404.html               HTTP 200  <title>Page not found | Lydia Moreno, Ph.D.</title>\r\nstyles.css            HTTP 200\r\npublications.bib      HTTP 200\r\n--- final validation ---\r\nValidated 4 HTML pages and all local links.\r\nRequired assets present: 9\r\nWorkflow security checks passed.\r\n--- symlinks (should be empty) ---\r\n--- workflow scan ---\r\n36:        uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3\r\n\r\n"]
[279.868271, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
